[Options]

[@1]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>He he I like our odds.

[@2]
<h2>~yGovenor of Sun</h2>
<p>Just be cause we surround them and outnumber them 5 to 3 doesn't mean they can't kill us.

[@3]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2>
<p>Look alive people!  They wouldn't just let rookies handle guarding an outpost like this one.

[A.]
<h2>Ambush</h2>
<i>"Counter attacks takes timing and brains to do."<br>
--Jean Franc, Nimbian General.</i>  
<p>With the new power you have gained from your last battle you have decided to launch an all out attack on the Elementals.  From some intellegence you have received you decide to ambush a poorly defended outpost.  Within a few minutes you have them surrounded and outflanked.
<p>Defeat the guards and press further into the Elementals domain.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have just givin yourself a good hold on the Elemental's territory.  From your posistion you will be able to defend from attacks and be able to launch another attack to penetrate deeper into enemy territory.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,tnron073=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron83

